WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.250
Opioid Crisis.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:08.062
The generation that took morphine for shrapnel wounds at Juno Beach came home and built lives.

00:00:08.062 --> 00:00:14.075
Their grandchildren are dying in alleys from poisoned fentanyl while Parliament debates semantics.

00:00:14.075 --> 00:00:25.425
Every number on this page comes from the Public Health Agency of Canada, Health Canada, the BC Coroners Service, Statistics Canada, and the government's own commissioned reports.

00:00:25.425 --> 00:00:33.662
They cannot deny what their own data proves: 47,000+ dead since 2016 — and counting.
